sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Teacher
    participant UI as Browser SPA (Canvas Lab)
    participant SimCtrl as SimulationController
    participant SimSvc as SimulationService
    participant RK4 as AnalyticalSolver (RK4)
    participant Canvas as Kinetic Canvas (Pixi.js)
    participant Gate as PhysicsLawValidator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (Supabase)

    Teacher ->> UI: Click Run and Verify Simulation
    UI ->> SimCtrl: POST /api/simulations/{id}/verify
    SimCtrl ->> SimSvc: executeVerification(simulationId)
    
    par Numerical Integration & Timeline Generation
        SimSvc ->> RK4: solveTrajectories(schemaId, initialParams)
        RK4 ->> RK4: Runge-Kutta 4th Order numerical integration
        RK4 -->> SimSvc: solvedTimeline (position, velocity, mechanical energy E)
    and Interactive Canvas Setup
        SimSvc -->> UI: Send initial parameters and scene descriptor
        UI ->> Canvas: Initialize Pixi.js canvas environment
        Canvas ->> Canvas: Render visual geometry at 60 FPS
        Canvas -->> UI: Canvas ready for playback
    end

    SimSvc ->> Gate: validateLawInvariants(solvedTimeline, lawCatalogue)
    Gate ->> Gate: checkConservationLaws(Energy, Momentum, Newton II)

    alt Domain Laws Satisfied (Status = VERIFIED)
        Gate -->> SimSvc: ValidationReport (status = VERIFIED, lawsPassed = 11/11)
        SimSvc ->> DB: UPDATE simulations SET status = 'VERIFIED'
        SimSvc ->> DB: INSERT INTO simulation_runs (validation_passed = true, status = 'VERIFIED')
        SimSvc -->> SimCtrl: VerificationResult (SUCCESS, VERIFIED)
        SimCtrl -->> UI: HTTP 200 OK (Model certified, all laws verified)
        UI -->> Teacher: Green verified badge and unlock Save/Assign controls
    else Physical Invariant Violated (Status = FLAGGED)
        Gate -->> SimSvc: ValidationReport (status = FLAGGED, violation = Energy Conservation Broken)
        SimSvc ->> DB: UPDATE simulations SET status = 'FLAGGED'
        SimSvc ->> DB: INSERT INTO law_gaps (kind = 'VIOLATION', status = 'FLAGGED')
        SimSvc -->> SimCtrl: VerificationResult (FLAGGED, triggerSelfRepair = true)
        SimCtrl -->> UI: HTTP 422 Unprocessable Entity (MSG-05: Law Violation)
        UI -->> Teacher: Warning banner and auto-route to AI self-repair loop
    end

